Q("The driver's advance was healthy because:", ["It was small", "Approved in policy, paid by referenced Payment Entry, recovery created the same sitting — four self-terminating deductions", "It was verbal", "It was interest-free"], 1, "Chapters 2, 5, and 6 in one case.", "Ch8"),
